ies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-k0223":{"code":"K-0223","title":"Provide exit doors that are held open by devices that will automatically close on the activation of a fire alarm or smoke detector.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0351":{"code":"K-0351","title":"Install an approved automatic sprinkler system.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0920":{"code":"K-0920","title":"Ensure proper usage of power strips and extension cords.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0578":{"code":"F-0578","title":"Honor the resident's right to request, refuse, and/or discontinue treatment, to participate in or refuse to participate in experimental research, and to formulate an advance directive.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0699":{"code":"F-0699","title":"Provide care or services that was trauma informed and/or culturally competent.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0552":{"code":"F-0552","title":"Ensure that residents are fully informed and understand their health status, care and treatments.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0644":{"code":"F-0644","title":"Coordinate assessments with the pre-admission screening and resident review program; and referring for services as needed.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0684":{"code":"F-0684","title":"Provide appropriate treatment and care